/**
 * The wallpaper pool for the auth panel — one picked at random per page
 * render. `AuthShell` is a Server Component with no "use client"/hooks, so
 * `Math.random()` here runs once server-side per request and ships straight
 * into the HTML; there's no client-side re-render of this component to
 * mismatch against (the hydration-mismatch risk `Math.random()` normally
 * carries only applies when the SAME component also runs client-side).
 */
// Ported verbatim from Kodely's PromptHero.tsx (SPIN_SQUARE) — the rotating
// gradient inside each glow clip must be a square larger than the clip's
// diagonal, or it stops covering the clip partway through its own rotation
// and the ring visibly vanishes and returns on a loop. 200% width +
// aspectRatio 1 gives a square of side 2x the clip's width, which always
// exceeds the diagonal; centering uses margins (not translate) because
// `transform` is owned by the glow-spin-a/-b rotation keyframes.
